{"name":"People of Bengaluru","short_name":"Bengaluru","description":"A stylised 3D Bengaluru you can walk through. Every character is a real designer or builder: find them in Koramangala and HSR Layout, see what they’re building, and say hi.","start_url":"/","display":"fullscreen","background_color":"#1C1F2B","theme_color":"#1C1F2B","icons":[{"src":"/icon.svg","sizes":"any","type":"image/svg+xml"}]}